# Benchmark runtime state. Raw results are teardown fuel (spec section 4): only derived claims go
# public, and the candidate backlog pool is private by design. `bench/results/*` (not `/results/`)
# so the one committed exception below can still be tracked: a bare `dir/` pattern would exclude
# the directory itself and git never re-descends into it to check a negation (#104 part 2).
bench/pilot-backlogs/
bench/results/*
!bench/results/proof-table.txt
